{"time": 1754733005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "317618993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "弩台射出的钢弹剥夺了水龙最后的力气，水龙弹簧般倒下，只剩些许简单的抽搐"}
{"time": 1754733196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "395885487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“小心一些..这还只是刚开始”"}
