{"time": 1754736832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1313952077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=395885487]工匠正在紧锣密鼓的检修刚刚被重装的金属炮架"}
{"time": 1754736958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1978828467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"....\"小心地盯着海面，叹口气，\"感觉很难帮上忙啦...\""}
{"time": 1754736980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1918586150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"这样的家伙还会来很多吗\""}
{"time": 1754737312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "91317467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不知道，按理说这种东西，在海里也不会很多”沧澜望着漆黑的海面，那里潮汐无序的翻涌，但没有明显朝岸边靠近的洋流"}
{"time": 1754737585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1734833612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"现在而言....只能等着了吧\""}
{"time": 1754737925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1499419080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "浪涌风流……风在变大，潮汐在它的无序之上被附加了一层别的运动"}
{"time": 1754738120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "226494079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"虽然很想说什么，但是这个节点也没什么可说的"}
{"time": 1754738264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "990844713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（真的吗）"}
{"time": 1754738268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "856839356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是翔哥呢）"}
{"time": 1754738335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "190690546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "([CQ:at,qq=1040972910] )"}
{"time": 1754738497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "752732840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "()"}
{"time": 1754738839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1013591518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“风变大了”夏弥有点神经质地抬头。云海也不再沉寂，翻涌起来，比海面更像海"}
{"time": 1754738969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "576405096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...也就是说，那家伙来了吗？\"叹口气，\"露儿收拾一下伤口...小心接下来的家伙吧\""}
{"time": 1754739069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1505933392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "使用回复药“好的..安姐姐”"}
{"time": 1754739078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1906662824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（安是安徽的安）"}
{"time": 1754739097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "340896611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（原来是安徽河南大冒险）"}
{"time": 1754739250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1916047335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "风在变大，天空中出现了与海相对的漩涡。连你也能清晰感受到，那个与你关联的存在"}
{"time": 1754739310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1477525048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "就在北方，移动的螺旋正在靠近，不急不缓"}
{"time": 1754739324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1184409079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "人群也骚动起来，大部分视线都朝天望去"}
{"time": 1754739446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1505105201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...我们也准备撤退吧...现在的事态已经不是普通人可以处理的了。\"皱着眉，对着身边的人开口，\"这家伙...\"拉着夏弥"}
{"time": 1754739918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "521741960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "云层露出一个口子。不至于能直视天光，但的确有一块变得亮而薄"}
{"time": 1754739948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1703595766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，要走吗？”"}
{"time": 1754739965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1070146997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "逐渐靠近，带着某种，不知是恩泽还是审判的光泽"}
{"time": 1754740203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2047929950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，快点走。\"几乎没有犹豫，拉着身边的人往后跑，\"快走!\""}
{"time": 1754740244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "318902872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，海水进一步上涨了……”沧澜看着海面“速度很快。附近的水流都在汇聚”"}
{"time": 1754740407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1850930823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(干啥啥不行，跑路第一名)"}
{"time": 1754740464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "367952034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "跟着跑路"}
{"time": 1754740478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "79317255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉晚上好像可以off了，龙神不是要审卡什么的）"}
{"time": 1754740506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1364307778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1754740595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1954389092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我们可以继续鸟了）"}
{"time": 1754740596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "971561137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "赫萝抬着头，注视着天渊，倒是没什么惧意。而已经陆陆续续有人在抛弃阵地逃跑了"}
{"time": 1754740608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "932846808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "跟着安一起跑"}
{"time": 1754740682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1512048055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "顺手捞住赫萝，\"别看了，我们先走。\""}
{"time": 1754740706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "504853632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=340896611]（怎么没人吐槽这个）"}
{"time": 1754740708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1418785282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好难受（））"}
{"time": 1754740730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "806027090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（安的安是安徽的安（））"}
{"time": 1754740786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "509082190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(跟河南人没什么好说的)"}
{"time": 1754740799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1497594020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（安徽安和河南露啊）"}
{"time": 1754741365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1561538511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1512048055]“哦……原来从这里看是这个样子”赫萝收住视线，跟着你们往高处走。但还有人不愿意放弃阵地"}
{"time": 1754741446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "167535913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"挣扎了一下对着能听到的人大声开口，\"岚龙来了，快走啊!\""}
{"time": 1754741718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1712471742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“待在这里神明大人会生气的，快跑吧”"}
{"time": 1754741734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "609119372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不，岚神会眷顾我们的！”留在原地的有一个人这么喊到“祂会帮我们击落海中的恶龙的”"}
{"time": 1754741758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "296348612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“岚神最讨厌别人观战啦”"}
{"time": 1754741812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1994539533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“....说不通。”不讲了，自己跑快点"}
{"time": 1754741831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "379880355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "至少你的吆喝没能使他放弃留守的念头"}
{"time": 1754742225, "type": "recv", "message_id": "376204911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "跑了反正"}
{"time": 1754742246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1264462846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "云团在移动，马上就经过你们的头顶。的确有种被照拂的奇妙感觉。并非雨过天晴，而是太阳色的风暴。岚并未驻足，而是直接朝海空行去，在海面上生成与云卷镜像的漩涡"}
{"time": 1754742274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "269959833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（忽然想好我的二技能机制了）"}
{"time": 1754742309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "292618360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...”反正不管怎么样，都不想驻足在这里，起码要去高地上"}
{"time": 1754742321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1866978943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（然后名字就致敬伊神了）"}
{"time": 1754742354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "912079878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感谢伊神给予的灵感（））"}
{"time": 1754742418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1626621428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "天空的破洞停住了，云团在酝酿什么，逐渐收紧，甚至有一些雨水倒卷着飞向天空"}
{"time": 1754742517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1363021101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "感觉有了些预感...“嗯...感觉会很不妙”"}
{"time": 1754742518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "308621943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=985D42CCAA9074B256373DC1E86D5E5C.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTgzb9dx2l0JUXo9ZUBvqx_3hVh_BiRkwEg_woo7Im6o939jgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQAnhgQDc44LdIlontBkzqYnoCd0A&amp;rkey=CAESMI-L3BvGniGkA4qqaUUfeN1WBtsrE9dZqtizpVLoFCVjIpaZ1EqUoCV8que4UNf6Mg,file_size=18833]"}
{"time": 1754742570, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1578642501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“大概要跑到哪里才算安全呢”"}
{"time": 1754742573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877177348", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "夏弥连挡雨的风障都不敢维持，而安……则在迷蒙中感受到了些许……天命。它无关情感，不是慈悲也不是制裁，更不是怒火。那是一种，无需刻意的潜意识，犹如呼吸"}
{"time": 1754742759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "560448213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=604A25A107C5601CC1209AC2891E9B9A.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTQO15HtB2x2OF0akb1Q_WOJOixbRjudiD_Cijr_ZiW3v2OAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhCuGLID3UbBt5r7nMGQ_i7KegIeXg&amp;rkey=CAESMI-L3BvGniGkA4qqaUUfeN1WBtsrE9dZqtizpVLoFCVjIpaZ1EqUoCV8que4UNf6Mg,file_size=15214]（小削一手）"}
{"time": 1754742867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1756649852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1877177348]不清楚这种感觉是什么，反正与自己从来都很遥远，此刻只想..远远地躲开，完全没有去和那种东西对决的勇气。"}
{"time": 1754742890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "915672999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（御主没有迅捷）"}
{"time": 1754742892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1124197729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说过好多次了）"}
{"time": 1754742906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2042297254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1754742913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "764957900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（我的评价是，这个有点神人，别闹翔÷）"}
{"time": 1754742930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2107350513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那还是自由吧）"}
{"time": 1754742942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1541601582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1754742949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1502344793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（自由复制自由挤，直接把魔力榨干（bushi））"}
{"time": 1754743103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1242122847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "似乎是锁定已经完成，天空陡然变得寂静。海中却有雷霆涌现"}
{"time": 1754743245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "353614167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"总觉得会看到不得了的东西，于是回过头看看"}
{"time": 1754743486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1874801326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "或许是反抗，或许是挣扎，总之一切在那连接天海、在百里以外都可见的水柱面前都失去了意义。没有雷声，声爆却清晰可闻，随后不知高度究竟为几何的水墙从冲击点开始扩散"}
{"time": 1754743679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1423969139", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "庆幸自己早就来到了高地，但是情况依旧不容乐观，\"得继续...往前走。\""}
{"time": 1754743854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "322524846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "到了近前，海啸的速度逐渐降低，但高度却越来越夸张"}
{"time": 1754744078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "175752907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "预估一下会不会砸到自己一行"}
{"time": 1754744126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "903777391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "明亮的天光重新开始移动，朝着北方的灵峰径直离开"}
{"time": 1754744143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1319731324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(要不打1吧（）"}
{"time": 1754744226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1308491036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "带着压抑的风暴和积雨云，风暴也一同移动起来，天色似乎都亮了几分"}
{"time": 1754744417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "724682312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"突发事件吗...\"叹口气，等那家伙先离开"}
{"time": 1754744634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1288058442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "岚龙还没走远，前潮已经迫近，二十余米高，不知多少吨的海水拍在岸上。把先前设置的哨卡和弩台全都淹没在水下"}
{"time": 1754744933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "510833662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "站在高点的位置，等待风波平息，\"它为什么突然来了...\"疑惑于这个问题，向旁边的人询问"}
{"time": 1754745145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "329373515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你问我吗）"}
{"time": 1754745239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2078764545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(问四周的人吧)"}
{"time": 1754745247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "323616002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(包括翔哥)"}
{"time": 1754745267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "205079832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "([CQ:at,qq=1040972910] )"}
{"time": 1754745282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1054548321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不知道……但是其实这种水炮，我们不是第一次见”夏弥缩在你怀里，述说不算遥远的记忆"}
{"time": 1754745453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1145563015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我唯独不想这么想啊。\"想起上一次的事，\"那次还是露儿惹出来的，你总不能说这家伙是什么自律机关吧\""}
{"time": 1754745594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1607316994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，不懂啊，毕竟上次我没看见来着”"}
{"time": 1754745659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1535454761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看一眼露儿，\"上次你弄出那种激光炮之后，这家伙就来洗地了。\"看一眼身后的泽国，\"这次又来。\""}
{"time": 1754745693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1712228709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“可能……领地问题吧”夏弥陷入思索“我跟安第一次见面也是差不多的原因”"}
{"time": 1754745773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1881461079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不用可能”赫萝努努嘴“那家伙就是很……小气”"}
{"time": 1754745781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "905357796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1712228709]\"哪有?说我触发了夏弥领地什么的...我才多大，又是普通人。\"戳戳，\"不过这么一说...倒是有可能?\""}
{"time": 1754745800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1344643827", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她说的是）"}
{"time": 1754745804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "388951025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（麒麟）"}
{"time": 1754745809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1795525467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她追着麒麟去的）"}
{"time": 1754746096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533000514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(哦，但是安又不清楚)"}
{"time": 1754746142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "648877269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，虽然抗一下应该没什么大碍?\"对这点有些不确定，\"姑且待会去确认一下吧。\""}
{"time": 1754746169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1945376445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那次是因为麒麟啦，在我的领地附近晃悠……弄得我的皮肤身上到处都是静电”夏弥吐吐舌头"}
{"time": 1754746524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "380585175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那个）"}
{"time": 1754746529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "56234289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（抗一下）"}
{"time": 1754746600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1611199658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（什么叫抗一下没问题）"}
{"time": 1754746665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "713392207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以我们现在是坐山观虎斗？”"}
{"time": 1754746711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1401179767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（斗完了）"}
{"time": 1754747083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1473756956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1754747123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2026337441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“看样子，岚神帮你报仇报了啊”"}
{"time": 1754747347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1568231500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不能这么算”沧澜摇摇头“祂是祂，我是我。不一样的”"}
{"time": 1754747366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "521009959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可是那条古龙应该已经死了吧...大概”"}
{"time": 1754747369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045523918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不过比起我见到海中那头的时候，这动静倒是确实……大了不少”"}
{"time": 1754747498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2119072694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=521009959]“嗯……我也不知道。”沧澜摇头“不过海中的古龙，对水制造的攻击……我觉得没那么容易”"}
{"time": 1754747859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "363386928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，所以说，带回去再要去确认一下\""}
{"time": 1754748199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "734009901", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（and？）"}
{"time": 1754748209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "555787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那去看看吧..就算没有死应该也是重伤吧”"}
{"time": 1754748262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539579003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "此刻下方曾是山地的地方已经被海流覆盖，不过正在很快退潮"}
{"time": 1754748270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1521703636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(怎么打出这种字的)"}
