{"time": 1754748280, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1683372195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1754748288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "716599639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=363386928](待会要去确认一下)"}
{"time": 1754748310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1386665972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(打出了好奇怪的字)"}
{"time": 1754748345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "912029417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1539579003]留意一下周围幸存的人数，那些自己找死的就不管了。"}
{"time": 1754748493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "267475202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么说人数）"}
{"time": 1754748569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1626408186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "海岸沿线大概有总共有六十多人，包括了那些负责器材建造的。大概是村里排的上号的全部猎人了"}
{"time": 1754748574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52605562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(大概就下面淹死了多少，多少跑了上来呗，跟一开始比起来)"}
{"time": 1754748606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1165505241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "淹死的应该不超过一手之数"}
{"time": 1754748764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1261922376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跟从着潮水退下走下高地，一路观察当时看见了海中雷霆的地方"}
{"time": 1754748899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "836007845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "有一处几乎已经消失的涡旋，还有无数浮沫"}
{"time": 1754748975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2101437773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "其他的？有没有血你看不清，至少没有浮尸"}
{"time": 1754748976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "311569995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我去海里看看？”"}
{"time": 1754749043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "949638944", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"拉住她，\"就算受了伤，它也是古龙。\"皱着眉，\"不要轻易下水。\""}
{"time": 1754749079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1583292018", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "打算在岸边等一等，看看事态变化"}
{"time": 1754749244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1930799742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看起来其他人也是这么想的。状态良好的人下水回收器材，好在天色稍亮了些。不过雨还在下。海在退潮，比你们来的时候低些，但仍高于常规水平"}
{"time": 1754749412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "125375690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "总是隐隐约约感觉事情还没结束，抓着自己的武器站在靠外的地方警惕着海面随时可能出现的动静。"}
{"time": 1754749431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "797898854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安姐姐会不会太紧张了”"}
{"time": 1754749453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "512803495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "浪倒是看起来正常了些，以某种频率缓缓起伏着"}
{"time": 1754749482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1437607921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我就靠近岸边看看...看能不能感觉到什么”"}
{"time": 1754749742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1301999537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...这种事怎么能当儿戏?\"皱着眉，\"试试倒是可以...我得和你一起。\""}
{"time": 1754749795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1737505506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“行，那走吧安姐姐”"}
{"time": 1754749951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1734636874", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "下海下海"}
{"time": 1754750003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "785780670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那，灵感？）"}
{"time": 1754750011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1186360065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd+1"}
{"time": 1754750011, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1186360065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[露儿]演奏出: 1D20+1={6}+1=7"}
{"time": 1754750018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "444867613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（没活）"}
{"time": 1754750085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "723845924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "与你第一次下海的感觉几乎一样。没什么风浪，潮汐自动涨落着"}
{"time": 1754750130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1010139341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm...好像什么也没感觉到，但不太确定，毕竟这个能力时灵时不灵的”"}
{"time": 1754750164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648516002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "很难感受出海中是否有什么异动，毕竟你甚至不知道源头离岸到底有多远"}
{"time": 1754750232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "968286500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跟在一边看着，把她拉起来，\"不要相信这些东西啦。\"吐出口气，\"这样的话，那家伙应该已经不在了？\""}
{"time": 1754750260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2031702490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "打定主意，等到潮水退回正常岸线就回村"}
{"time": 1754750311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1128146486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "海岸线停住了，高于正常水位，执拗地不肯继续退却"}
{"time": 1754750558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "87597982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"颇为头疼地摇了摇头，\"这家伙...似乎还没放弃啊。\"事到如今等在这里也没什么意义，\"露儿，准备回去了。\""}
{"time": 1754750599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1271290705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...话说明天好像还要回炎火来着，该回去休息了，好累Ծ‸Ծ”"}
{"time": 1754750842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "539389325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "招呼其他人准备撤出海岸线，\"今天顶着雨才回来...谁知道就遇到这种事，希望不会有后续了。\"伸个懒腰，准备离开。"}
{"time": 1754750864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1736514143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……嗯”沧澜欲言又止，不过最后还是应了一句，收回看向大海的目光"}
{"time": 1754750873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1492391814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（哎，下午断章好难受啊）"}
{"time": 1754750929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1728502942", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“沧澜是想趁他病要他命吗...我们两个面对受重伤的古龙胜算大有几成”在她耳边悄声问道"}
{"time": 1754751013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1553670739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我不好说，我也没见过受重伤的古龙”沧澜已经转过身了"}
{"time": 1754751037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "327474514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“偷偷去看看？”"}
{"time": 1754751160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1251193981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那我肯定不会管你的死活了，荷莱露)"}
{"time": 1754751258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "590914703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "沧澜有些迟疑“唔……至少，是个机会……”"}
{"time": 1754751288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "465507436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且它重伤我们就算打不过应该也能跑吧...”"}
{"time": 1754751532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "252531994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“至少上次我跑掉了”沧澜抬眉“那也就是说？”"}
{"time": 1754751551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "748512261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这次随便跑？”"}
{"time": 1754751744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1864217023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我的意思是……要去么？虽然没有打不过就不去的道理”"}
{"time": 1754751776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309965292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们不是本来就要去踩点的么..它伤那么重，现在肯定更好毒死了”"}
{"time": 1754751873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "292631244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那……”沧澜扭头看了一眼正在上行的其他几人"}
{"time": 1754751895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1191928337", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“叫上他们一起吗？”"}
{"time": 1754751917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1112209782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安姐姐感觉估计不会同意，不知道赫萝姐姐会不会一起去”"}
{"time": 1754751979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1549211849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(怎么下水我问你，靠根性吗)"}
{"time": 1754751985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1150179751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=539389325]“不过看起来不用我们也能解决就是了”夏弥从背后勾住你的脖子“说不定岚确实有在保护村子……至少在古龙防治上”"}
{"time": 1754752007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1717234479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过她们水性好像都不太好”"}
{"time": 1754752123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "180955232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1717234479]“嗯……不过我觉得应该告诉他们”沧澜面对着你，左侧是海，右边是岸"}
{"time": 1754752143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "662385334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“也对吧，那就听沧澜的”"}
{"time": 1754752160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "615565704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安姐姐..安姐姐...”朝上行的人喊"}
{"time": 1754752259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "804906890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1150179751]\"虽然...有种没把人类和村子放在眼里的感觉。\"抓着她的手，慢悠悠地回复，听到身后的动静，微微停下脚步，\"咋了?\""}
{"time": 1754752290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1400215188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "跑上去讲一下我们的踩点然后下毒的计划"}
{"time": 1754752466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1892462892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"听着听着笑了，\"再说一遍?\""}
{"time": 1754752738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095769052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“沧澜想要复仇，我想帮她，现在就是最好的时机啊”"}
{"time": 1754752757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "536505715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\".....^-^\""}
