{"time": 1754753021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1732374789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可能平常还好，但是现在重伤哎”"}
{"time": 1754753046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1915899602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“诶……你问我吗？”夏弥有些心虚“这种问题是不是问赫萝比较好”"}
