{"time": 1754755663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1421842801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=9EF3A0EAB95433554BB8619466A614A8.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSmOw-jCYTwjziFyPa4U1V6q2E80RjG3gog_woooeatn47-jgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQIzyf6XNR1pEmhd7mfpvg_HoC3qI&amp;rkey=CAQSMGWndlXhXHU3IcN2fSk-R1geO7tdSjXBWWXx7XyhIDDzPDB4S8hQ2AIvT_FnhWxREQ,file_size=175942]"}
{"time": 1754755731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "8010709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(起码把这里的剧情过掉)"}
{"time": 1754755803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "835204118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1754755818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1414487629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安姐姐说的对，我们确实考虑不周...”"}
{"time": 1754755829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2129443472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“沧澜，再想想其他计划吧..”"}
{"time": 1754756121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1074455572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……好吧”沧澜也没有坚持“下次准备充分一点，再来吧……”"}
{"time": 1754756138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1474855669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“果然还是要借一些外力么”"}
{"time": 1754756184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1406835660", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉...在场的人只有你们两个能轻松下水吧。\"想到了一个陆上的水生的家伙，\"绘梨衣，要不你也去海里转转?\""}
{"time": 1754756412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "742147177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……？还有我的事？”绘梨衣莫名被que“古龙……嘛，我是不怕。反正也不会比上次更糟”"}
{"time": 1754756491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "10773843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，算了。上次不知道是谁被打得半死\"摊摊手，摆出和自己无关的动作"}
{"time": 1754756508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "512673106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们再磨砺磨砺吧”拍拍沧澜的肩"}
{"time": 1754756619, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1979862954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……”沧澜点点头，又摇摇头“只是……有点慢。成长的速度什么的”"}
{"time": 1754757011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2055257686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...毕竟这种事也不能心急么，没办法的，或者我们能找到一些更稳妥的方法...把它变成人再杀掉会不会简单一点..”"}
{"time": 1754757073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1808067553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“会……吗？”沧澜的目光朝赫萝不着痕迹地瞥了一眼"}
{"time": 1754757294, "type": "recv", "message_id": "102691994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...变成人再...\"瞪一眼，\"我建议你不要这么想，真的做到那一步了，就没有退路了。杀人是完全不一样的。\"严肃开口，无奈叹气"}
{"time": 1754757387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1640840018", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安姐姐说的对...”想起之前父亲说过的话，毕竟变成人之后再狩猎性质完全不一样了，惭愧的低下了头"}
{"time": 1754757579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "721031324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"继续留在这里也没什么意义了，一边迈步离开，一边收拢自己的头发，\"说起来...头发都弄湿了，早上才花时间弄好的。\""}
{"time": 1754757896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "32251641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“回去帮你弄啦……”夏弥牵上你“毕竟刚刚我也不敢继续维持疏水了”"}
{"time": 1754758124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "943070181", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，那家伙真是有够任性的。\"吐槽一句，\"我们回去吧。\""}
{"time": 1754758183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "991061695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们也回去休息吧..”拉着沧澜回家喽"}
{"time": 1754758263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "133862704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那就）"}
{"time": 1754758267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1159713820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（回？）"}
